    "encoding_note": "SpaceWire signals over LVDS with Data-Strobe (DS) encoding: the Strobe signal changes whenever Data does not, so the clock is recovered as Clock = Data XOR Strobe. Characters are 10-bit data characters and 4-bit control characters (FCT/EOP/EEP/ESC), with NULL (ESC+FCT) and Time-Code (ESC + data character) composite codes, all carrying odd parity."
